		<div class="topic" id="forum_op_topic_563670705224451284">
		How is the AI?	</div>
	<div class="content" id="forum_op_content_563670705224451284">
		I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you.	</div>
		
	<div class="forum_op_footer">
		<div></div>
			</div>
</div>
<div data-featuretarget="community-awards"></div>
<script type="text/javascript">
	$J( function() {
		InitializeForumTopic( {"owner":"46180470","type":"General","feature":"0","gidforum":"561408759868569481","forum_display_name":"General Discussions","forum_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/940230\/discussions\/0\/","forum_search_url":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/940230\/discussions\/search\/","is_public":1,"permissions":{"can_view":1,"can_post":1,"can_reply":1,"is_banned":0,"can_delete":0,"can_edit":0},"appid":940230}, "https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/forum\/46180470\/General\/",
		"563670705224451284", {"author":"\u5c0f\u9ed1\u718apk","text":"I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you."}		);
