					<div class="forumtopic_answer answer_ctn" >
		<div class="forumtopic_answer answer_header" data-panel="{&quot;clickOnActivate&quot;:&quot;firstChild&quot;}" role="button">
		<a href="#c563670705224451488" >
			<img src="https://community.fastly.steamstatic.com/public/images/skin_1/icon_answer_large.png?v=1">
			A developer of this app has marked a post as the answer to the topic above.<br>
			Click here to jump to that post.		</a>
		<div style="clear:both"></div>
	</div>

		<div class="forumtopic_answer answer_body">
		<div class="forumtopic_answer answer_quote">
			<div class="answer_author bb_quoteauthor" >Originally posted by <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198043431473" data-miniprofile="83165745">Hogus</a>:</div>
						<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>小黑熊pk</b>:</div>I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you. </blockquote><br>Hi, i do plan to work on the for a unlimited period of time until the product is complete and satisfy our fan base.<br><br>As a fan player, i'm feeling the same from some games and don't want our country, populations, to behave stupidly so i'm really focus to make AI intelligent and will continue to optimize all part of the game including this one after release.		</div>
	</div>
	</div>
					<script type="text/javascript">
$J( function() { InitializeCommentThread( "ForumTopic", "ForumTopic_103582791475701878_561408759868569481_563670705224451284", {"feature":"561408759868569481","feature2":"563670705224451284","owner":"103582791475701878","commentthreadid":"659204652","total_count":3,"start":0,"pagesize":15,"has_upvoted":0,"upvotes":0,"votecountid":null,"voteupid":null,"commentcountid":null,"subscribed":false,"extended_data":"{\"topic_permissions\":{\"can_view\":1,\"can_post\":1,\"can_reply\":1,\"is_banned\":0,\"can_delete\":0,\"can_edit\":0},\"original_poster\":849514280,\"topic_gidanswer\":\"563670705224451488\",\"forum_appid\":940230,\"forum_public\":1,\"forum_type\":\"General\",\"forum_gidfeature\":\"0\"}","oldestfirst":true,"comments_raw":{"563670705224451488":{"text":"[quote=\u5c0f\u9ed1\u718apk]I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you. [\/quote]\n\nHi, i do plan to work on the for a unlimited period of time until the product is complete and satisfy our fan base.\n\nAs a fan player, i'm feeling the same from some games and don't want our country, populations, to behave stupidly so i'm really focus to make AI intelligent and will continue to optimize all part of the game including this one after release.","author":"Hogus"},"563671129707864558":{"text":"[quote=Hogus;563670705224451488][quote=\u5c0f\u9ed1\u718apk]I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you. [\/quote]\n\nHi, i do plan to work on the for a unlimited period of time until the product is complete and satisfy our fan base.\n\nAs a fan player, i'm feeling the same from some games and don't want our country, populations, to behave stupidly so i'm really focus to make AI intelligent and will continue to optimize all part of the game including this one after release. [\/quote]\nThat will be great\uff01I can\u2018t with to play Geoplanetical\uff01","author":"\u5c0f\u9ed1\u718apk"},"574930920107169450":{"text":"How are naval invasions? Even Supreme Ruler struggles with it and its more of a war game.","author":"The Refused Stone"}},"track_navigation":true}, 'https://steamcommunity.com/comment/ForumTopic/', 40 ); } );
</script>
