			<div class="commentthread_comment_text" id="comment_content_563670705224451488">
				<blockquote class="bb_blockquote with_author"><div class="bb_quoteauthor">Originally posted by <b>小黑熊pk</b>:</div>I've played some large 4X games, and when it comes to handling complex diplomacy and war economies, the AI often performs poorly, causing AI players to fall behind human players. How is the AI in Geoplanetical? Will the developers continue to update and optimize the AI after the game's release? Thank you. </blockquote><br>Hi, i do plan to work on the for a unlimited period of time until the product is complete and satisfy our fan base.<br><br>As a fan player, i'm feeling the same from some games and don't want our country, populations, to behave stupidly so i'm really focus to make AI intelligent and will continue to optimize all part of the game including this one after release.			</div>
